// Source: three partial interfaces of Navigator from W3C documents, copied
// on 2026-10-29: `maxTouchPoints` from Pointer Events Level 4
// (https://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents/), `webdriver` from WebDriver
// (https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/, NavigatorAutomationInformation) and
// `doNotTrack` from Tracking Preference Expression
// (https://www.w3.org/TR/tracking-dnt/).
//
// This file includes material copied from Pointer Events,
// https://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents/; WebDriver,
// https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/; and Tracking Preference Expression
// (DNT), https://www.w3.org/TR/tracking-dnt/. Copyright © 2026 World Wide
// Web Consortium. https://www.w3.org/copyright/software-license-2023/ (W3C
// Software and Document License; the full notice is in
// THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
//
// The interface Navigator is in html.idl (feature 8a2 of M8). The mixin
// NavigatorAutomationInformation of WebDriver is a partial interface here.

// Feature 10b of M8 adds `sendBeacon` from Beacon
// (https://w3c.github.io/beacon/, copied on 2026-10-30; W3C Software and
// Document License, Copyright © 2026 World Wide Web Consortium); its `data`
// is `any` (the union has buffer sources, which the generator cannot tell
// apart).
partial interface Navigator {
  boolean sendBeacon(USVString url, optional any data = null);
  readonly attribute long maxTouchPoints;
  readonly attribute boolean webdriver;
  readonly attribute DOMString? doNotTrack;
};
